name: ['Desert', 'Eternal Witness', 'Isochron Scepter', 'Pendelhaven', 'Remand', 'Resurrection', 'Serrated Arrows', 'Shrapnel Blast', 'Tendrils of Agony', 'Thirst for Knowledge', "Tormod's Crypt", 'Wall of Roots']
