rarity: ['Rare']
text: ['As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact.\\nShrapnel Blast deals 5 damage to any target.', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it into its owner's hand instead of into that player's graveyard.\\nDraw a card.", 'Defender\\nPut a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots: Add {G}. Activate only once each turn.', 'Draw three cards. Then discard two cards unless you discard an artifact card.', 'Imprint — When Isochron Scepter enters the battlefield, you may exile an instant card with mana value 2 or less from your hand.\\n{2}, {T}: You may copy the exiled card. If you do, you may cast the copy without paying its mana cost.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Serrated Arrows enters the battlefield with three arrowhead counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no arrowhead counters on Serrated Arrows, sacrifice it.\\n{T}, Remove an arrowhead counter from Serrated Arrows: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', 'Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'When Eternal Witness enters the battlefield, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile target player's graveyard.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Desert deals 1 damage to target attacking creature. Activate only during the end of combat step.', '{T}: Add {G}.\\n{T}: Target 1/1 creature gets +1/+2 until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"Think of this new life not as a gift from the angels but as a command to fight for their cause once more."\\n—War blessing of Serra', "Dominaria's most extravagant crypt nevertheless holds an empty grave.", 'Gaea needs no book to record every act.', 'Raissa transformed herself into a vessel for the Watchword Codex, allowing the arcane lore to flow through her body.', 'Root systems in Mwonvuli twist through currents of mana rather than soil.', 'The limbs of Pendelhaven extend as far as the meek roam, and reach as high as they strive.', 'To the Krark Clan, every artifact has a trigger and a barrel.']
artist: ['Brian Despain', 'Bud Cook', 'Glen Angus', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'John Avon', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Philip Straub', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Volkan Baǵa']
